  "releaseNotes": "10.0.41.3: New OpenMaui.Hosting package — call .UseLinux() unconditionally on all platforms (no-op on non-Linux, no #if required). App icon support (MauiIcon build targets, .desktop file integration for GNOME/Wayland), dark mode for picker popups, popup edge detection, DPI-correct popup rendering, flyout selected item text visibility fix, adaptive gesture method signatures.",
